WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.598
- So, I don't know if you've heard,

00:00:01.598 --> 00:00:02.899
but it's almost Christmas.

00:00:02.899 --> 00:00:04.469
- [Josh] I have heard, yes.

00:00:04.469 --> 00:00:06.670
- What's the Groban household like?

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.330
- Well, I mean, I grew up

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:10.330
with just such magical Christmases.

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:11.183
I was very lucky.

00:00:13.535 --> 00:00:15.190
My dad comes from a Jewish family,

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:19.170
but when he married my mom,
my mom is so Christmas-y.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:21.590
She loves putting Santas every.

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:22.520
She's got a collection of Santas

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:26.070
and she loves trees and
and decorations so much

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:27.330
that even if there isn't room,

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:29.193
we'll find a place for a second tree.

00:00:29.193 --> 00:00:30.170
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:32.783
The house growing up smelled
like such a forest that-

00:00:32.783 --> 00:00:33.681
- Oh, they're real trees.

00:00:33.681 --> 00:00:35.560
- Oh they're real trees, oh yeah, yeah.

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:36.960
- She went deep.
- I think there was a bird

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:38.201
in one of them once.
- Wow.

00:00:38.201 --> 00:00:40.490
- Yeah, it's a whole thing, so.

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:41.890
- Like a real bird?

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:43.550
- Oh yeah, yeah, it was
still alive thankfully.

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:45.180
We cut it down, tied it to our car,

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:47.300
drove it home, and then
it was like (cawing).

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:48.830
So.
- Oh my God!

00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:50.170
- Yeah, it got out okay.

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:52.161
- But speaking of your childhood home,

00:00:52.161 --> 00:00:54.220
and just your childhood in general,

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.920
you love to share throwback photos

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:57.430
so here's one.

00:00:57.430 --> 00:00:59.040
So give me the backstory
of this little one.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:00:59.873
- [Josh] Oh hey!

00:00:59.873 --> 00:01:02.943
- [Kelly] What's up, you are
so cute in your short shorts.

00:01:02.943 --> 00:01:04.900
- [Josh] Have you done "Who
Wears Short Shorts?" yet

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:05.886
for your karaoke?

00:01:05.886 --> 00:01:06.719
- [Kelly] No!

00:01:06.719 --> 00:01:08.256
- [Josh] Look at those shorts, I am-

00:01:08.256 --> 00:01:09.730
- [Kelly] Those shorts are awesome!

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:10.960
- [Josh] I'm the original Evan Hanson.

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:11.793
Look at that arm.

00:01:11.793 --> 00:01:12.626
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:12.626 --> 00:01:14.900
I think that is the exact moment I knew

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:16.675
that the arts were for me.

00:01:16.675 --> 00:01:17.508
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:17.508 --> 00:01:19.435
Yeah, you can see the look on my face.

00:01:19.435 --> 00:01:22.587
If you zoom in, you can see
the sadness behind the eyes.

00:01:22.587 --> 00:01:23.995
- [Kelly] Oh my god, that's amazing!

00:01:23.995 --> 00:01:25.746
- [Josh] I wanna be in a play so bad.

00:01:25.746 --> 00:01:27.797
- (laughs) You look adorable!

00:01:27.797 --> 00:01:28.630
- [Josh] Oh, thank you, bless your heart.

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:29.600
- And so cute with your little cast.

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:31.710
- Man, little Joshy on
"The Kelly Clarkson Show."

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:32.600
Look at that.
- It's adorable.

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:34.853
We love kid pics.
- Full circle.

